{"name":"Transfer receipt shows the stored amount with two decimals, blank if the transfer does not exist","category":"policy","priority":"P2","statement":"The transfer receipt displays the requested transfer number and the amount recorded for that transfer in TRANSFERENCIAS, formatted with two decimals (\"0.00\"). If no transfer exists with that number, the amount is shown blank and no error is raised.","condition":"Look up TRF_MONTO in TRANSFERENCIAS where TRF_NUMERO equals the requested number. If a row is found, the amount is available. Otherwise it is not.","action":"Show the transfer number as text. If an amount was found, show it formatted as \"0.00\". If not, show an empty string."}

